{"id":"n32191-1-24","stage":2,"title":"근심 · 担心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32191-1-24-1","ko":"표정이 어두운데 무슨 근심 있어요?","zh":"你表情好阴郁，有什么烦恼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"표정이","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어두운데","meaning":"阴暗，阴沉","explanation":"어둡다：阴暗，阴沉；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"3","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"근심","meaning":"担心，担忧","explanation":"근심：担心，担忧","readings":[{"term":"근심","audio":"/audio/5c7c27dc0ce0c039476c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32191","senseId":"1","lemma":"근심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"阴暗，阴沉","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"气氛、表情、性格等低落消沉。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"5c7c27dc0ce0c039","term":"근심","zh":"担心，担忧","audio":"/audio/5c7c27dc0ce0c039476c.mp3","entryId":"32191","definition":"想到也许会发生不好的事情而感到害怕、不安的心情。","pronunciation":["근심"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9323500369dfdf6b44f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32191-1-24-2","ko":"시험을 잘 못 봤어요.","zh":"我考试考得不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험을","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어요.","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b47add00125edaaf3d3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.996,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32191","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.8227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你表情好阴郁，有什么烦恼吗？","我考试考得不好。","你知道朴教授的研究室在哪里吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你表情好阴郁，有什么烦恼吗？","我考试考得不好。","你知道朴教授的研究室在哪里吗？"],"answer":1}]}
